```wireframe
board "Sign up" accent=#FF5A1F
  screen desktop "Sign up"
    navbar "Brand" leading=logo
    stack column gap=16 padding=24 width=400
      heading "Create your account" level=2
      input "Name" placeholder="Jane Doe"
      input "Email" type=email placeholder="jane@example.com"
      input "Password" type=password placeholder="********"
      checkbox "I agree to the Terms of Service"
      button primary "Create account" fullWidth
```
